        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "47, we have located a Providence Assassin that goes by the name &quot;The Vulture&quot;, his real name is Zana Kazem. We have hacked Mr. Kazems mobile phone and found out that he got invited by Omar Al-Ghazali himself to the Grand Opening of the Burj Al-Ghazali, the tallest building in the world. In the E-mail he send he put in the words &quot;Red Force&quot;. We need you to eliminate Omar Al-Ghazali, &quot;The Vulture&quot; and also retrieve &quot;The Vultures&quot; mobile phone so we can investigate further into this &quot;Red Force&quot;.",
